{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d5_level_act15d5_st07",
  "groupId": "act15d5",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "为更好的自己",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st07.txt",
  "sourceHash": "99fb3a085cb030dfbc3c2211de2a322c46a7d571d6cd143ac6388831f12ed483",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "这次真是太感谢宴小姐，还有豆苗小姐了，愿意陪我出来找草药。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "如果只有我一个人的话，肯定不会这么顺利......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "没什么，我也难得接这样的外勤任务，还挺新鲜的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "别叫得这么生疏啦，叫我宴就好。女孩子结伴一起外出应该高高兴兴，亲亲密密的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "我们不已经是朋友了吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊，是、是这样吗？！朋友......可是我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "我......我一点也不懂时尚，也不太会聊天......真的可以和宴小姐做朋友吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "说什么呢，有什么可以不可以的？只要在我通讯录上，能叫出来一起逛街的，就都是朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "看，我也把末药加进去了哟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "好厉害！宴小姐......宴认识好多人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "咦，这里的分组是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "啊，那是“午休时间美甲”组，算是我通讯录里人数最多的分组了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "这个呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "这是“团购优惠券分享”组。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "那，这个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "“不参加活动但愿意来付钱”组！哈哈，这里面的可都是需要好好珍惜的好朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "（如果被加在这个分组里......我可能......会哭......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "（......应该不会吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哦，听起来很不错嘛，这个组里的好朋友也介绍给我认识一下吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊！豆苗小姐，你回来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "久等了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "前头的路稍微有点难走，多费了点时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "顺便一问，宴你把我和末药分在哪里？不是那个好朋友组吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "放心，你就是想进也进不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "你是“下次一定换我请客”，她在“医疗部”里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "哈？等下，你这什么意思？明明我请客的次数也不少吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "而且，为什么只有末药的分组这么朴素啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊哈哈......我觉得挺好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "人家替我治病呢，多少也要尊重点吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "（小声）况且谁敢随便得罪医生啊。我又不傻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "哎呀别在意这种小事。你刚刚不是探路去了吗，怎么样，这周围还有没有我们这次要找的药草？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "我看这次也已经采集了不少了，要是没有的话，差不多就能收工了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "哼，我正要说这事！分组的账之后再和你算......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "嗯咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "先从结论上来说——我确实有点收获。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "刚刚我让阿盘它们分头去找，发现从这儿再往北边去一点的地方，确实有一片我们还没去过的绿地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "阿盘就是你养的那些小宠物？还挺有本事嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "那当然！嘿嘿，这么点小事根本难不倒我的小家伙们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "这里往北......从湿度、光照和地形上来说，确实很适合药草生长！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "太好了，那我们快点过去吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "哎，等等，听我说完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "嗯......配给的区域图，我找找......有了！你们看这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "我们现在的位置在我标了红点的这里，那片绿地大概在这个位置，就这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊，这里是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "唔？我看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "啊哦，原来我们离舰后已经走了这么远？前面这块，上面写的是......伊什么......啧，这字也太小了，伊比利亚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "伊比利亚啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "我听说那边的移动城市会变色，驶过的土地都寸草不生，不知道是不是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "欸，骗人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "如果是源石能源技术问题带来的污染，对土地造成一定影响还是有可能的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "但是寸草不生......是不是有点太夸张了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "这才哪到哪儿啊，这根本不算夸张的。还有人说伊比利亚的城市都会变形呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "城市里的地块都能飞起来重组到一起，变成没手没脚，会把所有东西都吞掉的巨大怪物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "会、会变成怪物吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "这个，和我听到的好像不太一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "怎么说起这个了，现在不是该决定要不要继续往前走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "还是说，到了什么伊比利亚流言蜚语共享时间吗？嗯......也不是不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "反正我们这里没人敢说自己了解伊比利亚吧？那不如各自说说自己知道的，没准能做参考呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "嗯......这么说也是啦，反正也不赶时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "我已经说过了，那下一个！末药你来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "欸，我也要说吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "当然~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "好、好的......虽然，可能没有什么参考价值......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "那个，我听说，伊比利亚有很多幽灵城市......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "（小声）啊——这不是和我说的差不多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "（小声）好了好了，你别插嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "据说迷路的人会误入这样的幽灵城，里面又冷又可怕，地上铺的都是青色的石头，教堂里一个人也没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "但是......仔细看的话，会发现城里的建筑虽然空空荡荡，却都镶着珠宝，而广场上堆满雕像，那些雕像全都是黄金打造，没有一丝杂质。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "珠宝！黄金！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "欸，这怎么听起来那么像黄金城的故事，我老爹可会唱那首歌了，我小的时候特别向往！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "如果真有那样的城市就好了，满地珠宝黄金啊......真想亲眼见一见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊哈哈......我觉得还是不要有机会见到比较好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "听说在幽灵城里，每到夜晚，就总会有看不见的东西在教堂里祈祷，还能听到有人在耳边叹气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "而且，误入这些城市的人，身体都会逐渐僵硬，行动越来越慢，变得像是老爷爷老奶奶一样，连说话也越来越慢，渐渐地无法思考......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "哇哦。这可是酷刑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "最后全身都动不了，既不能说话，也没有思想......整个人变得和街上的黄金雕像一样，呜，原来那些雕像原本都是活着的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "......好恐怖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "骗、骗人的吧？怎么可能会有这样的事......这不是比我说的还不靠谱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "肯定是假的啦，故事是挺不错的，但如果真的没有人活着出来，传言又是从哪来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "是呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "所以我才说，没有什么参考价值的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "这都是以前和哈默妮一起四处探险的时候，听别人说的......并不是什么靠得住的情报。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "探险？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊，其实......在来罗德岛之前，我和朋友经常到各种地方探险，越危险的地方，越是会有珍稀的药草。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "欸，看不出来，末药你也挺能干的嘛。我还以为你是那种不太出门，整天就蹲在屋子里配药的类型呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "而且胆子还很小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "没有啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "现在是不是该轮到我说了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "我刚刚想了一下，好像还真听谁说过这一类的传言......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "欸欸，还要说吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "你对这些东西还真感兴趣啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "说说而已嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "唔，你们知不知道伊比利亚有个狂欢节？这个节日倒不是什么流言，而是真实存在的，我在书上看到过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "听说这是个特别热闹的节日，过去还有不少游客参加，可是现在都好久没有什么消息了，就有人说，这节已经被废止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "但是呢......我听说啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "听说什么？你，你别用这种语气说话，让人毛毛的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "确实有一点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "好嘛，不吓你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "其实也没什么，只是据说狂欢节其实没被废止，只是参加的不是正常人而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "据说到了那一天，满大街都是从坟里爬出来的尸骸，缺胳膊断腿的在一起狂欢呢。这时候城里的市民都得呆在家里关好门，千万不能出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "那要是，出来了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "这我就不知道了，有挺多不同的说法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "有人说出门就会被吃掉，还有人说出去的人就和中了什么迷魂咒一样，会排着队去城东的树林里上吊自尽呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "反正不管怎么想，总归不会有什么好下场就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "好，说完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "怎么样，还要听吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "哎，你的表情变僵硬咯。该不会是......你怕了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "怎、怎么可能！我才不会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "好好，你没在怕的。那我就继续说啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "（宴，脸上完全是乐在其中的表情了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "（唉......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "那个，我们是不是......偏题了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "......是哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "不要忘记正事呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "这些流言奇奇怪怪的，我觉得没什么参考价值。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "只是听着还是挺瘆人的。你是不是想这么说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "不过呢，恐怕也就是因为整个地区都封锁了，所以传言才越来越离谱吧，这倒是也挺正常的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "所以，我们还要往北走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "草药应该已经采集了不少了吧？要不然......呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豆苗",
      "text": "......要不然，还是算了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "嗯？末药，怎么啦，怎么突然发呆？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "啊，没什么，我没事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "只是稍微有点在意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末药",
      "text": "会有这么多吓人的传言，伊比利亚......到底是个什么样的地方呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顽皮的孩童",
      "text": "别跑，臭小子！你别跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的孩童",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顽皮的孩童",
      "text": "何塞，你敢不听我的！站住，我让你不许跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顽皮的孩童",
      "text": "你......哎，你哭什么哭，这可是你自己摔倒的，我可没碰你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顽皮的孩童",
      "text": "快起来！别想再耍什么小聪明......都怪你和学堂的老师说我坏话，害我被教训！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我没有，我没有说谎话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我看见了！安东尼奥，就是你偷拿了米丽萨婶婶放在桌上的零钱——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "啊，你还敢说！你这告密的小人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我......不是！不是小人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉，孩子们，不要这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "一时的怒火会让我们犯错。别被情绪弄昏了头脑，来，孩子，起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "谁多管闲事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "呃......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "你——不对，您是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "这位，这位老爷，谢谢您......没关系的，不用扶，我站得起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我身上有泥，别脏了您的手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊，很谢谢你替我考虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但是很不必这样。谁会说泥土是脏东西？我们吃穿，都从土里生长来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "搀着我的手，站稳。对，这就对了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "这位老爷，您是城里来的大老爷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你认得我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "村里传遍了，说今天有个城里来的大老爷，要给村里演......什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "演讲，对了，是要做演讲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "老爷，您就是来做演讲的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是的。你很敏锐，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我被委任，到这里来与各位讲诉我们可贵的崇高律条......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "您是教会的教士老爷！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "是的，我是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "您会给我们讲教会的那本律法，还有拉特兰的那些故事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我会的。但是，孩子，我并不会只讲这些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我们的律法教我们，崇高的条律坚不可摧，我们该相信，该遵守，该尊崇。这很对。这是正确的......正确，却有距离。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我是一介凡人，所见未必比他人更高尚，所以，我还会说很多我们身边的值得称颂的故事。我是为缩短我们与条律的距离而来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "老爷，您是想说......什么？太难了，我搞不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "哎，教士老爷，您往哪边走，要去村长家吗，我领着您去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "多谢你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我说什么不重要，重要的是——你听到什么。不用勉强。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "是往这边走？哎，小心，别踩到这里的花，让它们好好长吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "请、请等一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "教士老爷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "什么事，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我想问......刚刚，您是不是都看到了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "您看到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "......刚刚我说的，那件事，您都，都听见了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "——我不能否认。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "从你摔倒开始，恐怕我听得一清二楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "老爷，这位老爷，我、我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "老爷！不是这样的，您别听我瞎说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "那些都是瞎说的，您别听！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "你认为自己在说傻话，真的是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "安东尼奥并不是坏人，只是，他只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "......没错！是、是我说了傻话！看错了......对，是我看错了！安东尼奥并没有偷拿东西，老爷！是我看错了，您不要抓他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "何塞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "何塞，你......你别这样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我、我知道说谎话不对。但我嫉妒安东尼奥，明明我的成绩比他好，但却连饭都吃不饱，很快就要读不起书了，我嫉妒他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "盗窃是会被抓走的，我知道，隔壁的胡戈大哥就是在城里偷拿了店里的东西，被抓就再也没回来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "所以我卑鄙地向教师告发他，诬陷他！这都是我的错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我知道错了，您要抓就抓我吧！呜，求您不要抓走他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "......“我们不当蒙蔽他人，同时令自己蒙尘”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "你胡说什么！谁要你这样了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "是我！教士老爷，既然您都听到了，是我拿了钱......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "安东尼奥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "别再说了，何塞。别......再为了我说谎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "你从不是这样的人！上回老佩多罗将你腿都打断，你不也没改口替他做伪证吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "啊。谎言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "没有坚持的谎言会摧毁人，这是卑鄙的。但是......带着善意的谎言却会成就人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "继续说，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "并没什么更多可说的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "我偷拿了米丽萨婶婶的钱，之后我会还！我已经在镇上找了一份工，报酬很不错哩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "偷拿是我不好，我会去道歉。但只要宽限一段时间，我就有钱能还了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "但是为什么，为什么要做这样的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "......学费......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "你、你不想继续读书吗？！你学得比其他人都好，我知道就差一点钱——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "嘁，刚刚的不算！你管我干嘛，和你没关系！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "就是这么一回事，我爱拿就拿了，都说了会还的，被你看到算我运气不好！要怎么惩罚我都认了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "教士老爷，您是要抓我吗，那就带我走吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "安东尼奥......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "别着急，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "你认为自己做错了事，对吗？那么，现在你要忏悔吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "对、对了！忏悔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "只要认错，得到宽恕就不用再受惩罚了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "教士老爷，教士老爷求您原谅他吧，您宽恕安东尼奥吧！他会改好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "我......律条里说，不当偷窃，不当欺瞒，我是做错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "......可我并不后悔。我只能想到这个办法了，就算要被罚，我也不后悔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "老爷，不后悔的人也可以忏悔吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "这取决于你怎么想。你自己的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我们都有弱点。谁能不犯错？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "但凡犯错，是否忏悔就能得到宽恕？可是有谁能够宽恕另一个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "......我不明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "我做的难道不是错事？做了错事却不忏悔，我真是个坏东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "一时犯下小错，就成了坏人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "怀有恶意犯下一件过错，即便已受到相应的惩戒，恶意当真就消退，罪人就不是罪人了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "这......不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "安东尼奥偷盗钱财，触犯戒条。而你，何塞，你刚刚却为包庇他，而对我说了谎，违背戒律。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "那么你认为他是恶人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "谎言也为教条所不耻。你认为自己是恶人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我不是......可我，我确实做错了呀！安东尼奥也做错了，他要是不忏悔，那要怎么才能得到宽恕呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我们难道能够容忍作恶么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "当然不，何塞。当然不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我们的典律给我们生活的规范，惩罚错恶，指点向善。在法典之下，没有恶行应当被容忍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "律条给出的是惩戒。它有力量，会罚真正犯下过错的罪人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "指人向善却不是一味惩罚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "我爹说是大棍和笤帚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "书上说......是悔过。先悔过，承认错，再改过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "你们说的都没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "你们知道错误，懂得友爱，互相着想，这很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "但......“凡要指出错处，先例出正确的给他看”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "安东尼奥，你要先问自己这个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "问自己。所以的事情，是在哪里有了差错，才让我们不得不犯下罪行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "安东尼奥，你为何偷窃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "因为......因为我力气比成年人小，很少有人愿意雇我干活。我没法凑够钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "不是的！安东尼奥都是为了帮我......都怪我自己没本事，呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "都说了不是了！你、你不许哭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "......我懂了，教士老爷。要是我再有点本事，能再早点找到活干，拿到钱，我就不会干那样的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我也是......要是我再强壮点，我也能干活，就不会连累别人了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我很高兴你们其实都已经发现问题的关键所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我们的躯体往往贫弱，致使我们即便有好的初衷，也要通过不当的手段才能达成。我们的许多同胞因此而犯错，我感到很惋惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "不过——当然，我们能够战胜这样的困境。我们的律条承自拉特兰，经过那些光辉先哲们的播撒，在我们脚踏的这片土壤上焕发绵长的光彩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "它会帮助我们度过百年前灾变后暗无天日的时光，也会帮助我们战胜我们自身的贫弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我希望，我们的信徒不要认为律条是一种束缚，更多地看到其中最纯粹的部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "什么......太深奥了，老爷，我们要怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "保持信仰。这你们已经做得很好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我们团结，我们向善，我们做一切好的事，这是因律条涤净了我们的心灵，使我们看清我们心中本就有的善，看清它本来的面貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "这才是我想要告诉你们的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "去相信。相信心灵有力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "虔心，友善，爱人。“为有需要的人提供帮助，对他们好，就像对我们的手足那样”，安东尼奥，你为何塞而犯错，何塞你呢，也因袒护伙伴吐露谎言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "盗窃与谎言都是错误的。但你们承认错处，这小小的叛逆也就很快能够被改过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我不会因此过于苛责你们。反而要说，我们正要像对兄弟一样对待彼此，由友爱驱使去行动。或许我们个体微小，友爱与团结却会使我们壮大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "只要我们相信法典的教诲，发掘其中对善的鼓励与呼唤，我们的心意将更贴近，就像最要好的兄弟姐妹那样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "这样，我们将最终唤醒我们的心灵。唤醒其中的善与力量......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "它将使我们无坚不摧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "呃，我听不太懂，老爷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "我也不太明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "何塞",
      "text": "教士老爷，这听起来很难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "别怕苦，也别怕难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "没关系，就算一时不理解，在你心中的东西也不会折损。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村妇",
      "text": "主教阁下！您怎么走到这儿来了，演讲台已经搭好了，大伙儿都在等着听您讲道呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村妇",
      "text": "这、这是怎么了？这两个小子没做什么冒犯您的事儿吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "他们很好，都是很好的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "来吧，不能让大家等太久，安东尼奥，劳烦你带路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安东尼奥",
      "text": "好、好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "还有何塞......来，我们一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "我们站到广场上去，让他人与我们一起认识自己的过错。然后令自己更强大，令自己更善，更美。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "将来不论要做什么事，首先分清自己的心意，质问你的心，这想法、这冲动，是否的确发自真心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "令伊比利亚更好，令我们更好的力量就来自心灵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "记住，孩子们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊比利亚主教",
      "text": "你只要相信你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
